# ML Problem Framing

## Project: Customer Churn Prediction

### 1. Problem
Predict whether a customer is likely to leave a service.

### 2. Objective
Identify customers who may leave and help the company improve customer retention.

### 3. Prediction Target
The target column is churned.
- 1 = Customer left
- 0 = Customer stayed

### 4. Input Features
- Customer tenure
- Support tickets
- Monthly spending
- Last login
- Plan type

### 5. ML Algorithm
Logistic Regression.

### 6. Evaluation Metrics
- Accuracy
- Precision
- Recall
- F1 Score

### 7. Responsible AI
- Protect customer information.
- Avoid biased predictions.
- Keep human review.
- Monitor model performance.

### 8. Conclusion
Machine learning can help identify customers
who may leave and support better decisions.
